<view class="page"><view class="card detail-visual"><image src="{{product.image}}" mode="aspectFit"></image></view><view class="title">{{product.name}}</view><view class="pill-row"><text class="tag">{{role.name}}IP</text><text class="tag">{{product.category}}</text></view><view class="status-tag">{{product.status}}</view><view class="card section"><view class="section-title">设计理念</view><view class="muted">{{product.story}}</view><view wx:if="{{product.conceptNote}}"><view class="label">概念说明</view><view class="muted">{{product.conceptNote}}</view></view><view class="label">适用场景</view><view class="muted">{{product.scene}}</view><view class="label">设计标签</view><view class="muted">{{product.tagText}}</view><view class="label">设计状态</view><view class="muted">本展品为原创IP联名概念设计，仅用于文创展厅宣传与方案展示，不代表已联名、已生产、可购买或具备官方授权。</view></view><button class="btn btn-full" bindtap="intent">{{wished?'♥ 已收藏':'♡ 收藏设计'}}</button><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-full" bindtap="favorite">加入内容收藏</button><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-full" bindtap="bless">生成祝福卡</button></view>
